    S.arrested=true;S.flags.croweConfronted=true;log('Silas Crowe detained','Crowe was taken in for questioning under the warrant. He denies killing Mara and says the missing register was planted. The charge will depend on evidence beyond the staging.');advance(18,'arrest');openModal('Silas Crowe in custody','INTERVIEW ROOM · RECORDED',`<div class="person-details"><span class="person-avatar avatar-one">SC</span><div><h3>Silas Crowe</h3><small>PARISH ARCHIVIST · DETAINED UNDER WARRANT</small></div></div><div class="dialogue-line">“You found a book. You found what someone wanted you to find. I did not kill Mara.”</div><p>Under direct questioning, Crowe admits he altered the Ninth Verse years ago to frighten parishioners away from the closed tower. He denies being there on the night Mara died. His admission explains the staged symbol, not the murder.</p><div class="statusline">DETENTION IS NOT A CONVICTION · CAUSE OF DEATH STILL REQUIRES PROOF</div>`,[{label:'CONTINUE TO CASE REVIEW',kind:'primary',run:()=>endingModal()}])
