al}])}});actions.push({label:'EXAMINE THE NAVE',run:()=>{S.player.stress=Math.min(100,S.player.stress+8);advance(15);openModal('A silence between bells','ST. ORAN · NAVE',`<p>The last rows are damp though the roof is sound. For one breath, the stained glass seems to show a figure standing behind you. When you turn, only the empty aisle remains.</p><p class="subtle">Stress rose. The experience may be exhaustion, suggestion, or something you cannot verify.</p>`,[{label:'COLLECT YOURSELF',run:()=>{S.player.stress=Math.max(0,S.player.stress-4);closeModal()}}])});actions.push({label:'LEAVE PARISH',run:closeModal});openModal('St. Oran Parish','PARISH HALL · FOUNDED 1891',`<p>Warm candlelight and rain-dark coats. The parish is open for evening prayer. A volunteer tells you the bell has been kept silent since the storm, then corrects herself: “Except the one time.”</p><div class="statusline">SECT LEAD · THE LANTERN OF THE NINTH DAWN</div>`,actions)}
